      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787864818657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n-> High availability - System should be available all the time \nso the shortened URLS work always\n-> Security - Prevent malicious content and phishing.\n-> Scalability - Should be able to handle a large volume of URLs.\n-> Performance - Minimal latency when clicking a shortened URL\nand redirecting to the original URL\nChoosing High availability over consistency",
      "fontSize": 39.360528612372754,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n-> High availability - System should be available all the time \nso the shortened URLS work always\n-> Security - Prevent malicious content and phishing.\n-> Scalability - Should be able to handle a large volume of URLs.\n-> Performance - Minimal latency when clicking a shortened URL\nand redirecting to the original URL\nChoosing High availability over consistency",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
